WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Narrator: Watch Majed.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.800
Majed: Run for the car park!

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:08.100
Narrator: He films the sky, then guesses - and sends fans running into the open.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:14.600
Narrator: That's the opposite of what Civil Defense ask, and the rush on the stairs is dangerous too.
